# Allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is listed below, so the
# kubeconfig, .env files, .context/ and infra/terraform/local.env never can.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!config/registry/
# Re-exclude what the allowed folders can hold.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
